{"4338430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Waste Of Space", "steam_appid": 4338430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Waste of Space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe didn’t fall apart in a war.<br>It fell apart in a meeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Waste of Space</strong></i> is a space-based card-collector and deck-builder set in a future where interplanetary governance has collapsed into bureaucracy, opportunism, and quiet rebellion. You assemble crews, ships, and equipment from a growing pool of catastrophically unqualified assets, deploy them on missions across the Solar System and beyond, and decide which broken vision of the future survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through turn based tactical combat missions to confront bosses in Deck fights, collect the cards of toppled leaders and add them to your own inventory - or leave them to rot in the wastelands you defeated them in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is vast. Your crew is terrible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proceed anyway.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Waste of Space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe didn’t fall apart in a war.<br>It fell apart in a meeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Waste of Space</strong></i> is a space-based card-collector and deck-builder set in a future where interplanetary governance has collapsed into bureaucracy, opportunism, and quiet rebellion. You assemble crews, ships, and equipment from a growing pool of catastrophically unqualified assets, deploy them on missions across the Solar System and beyond, and decide which broken vision of the future survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through turn based tactical combat missions to confront bosses in Deck fights, collect the cards of toppled leaders and add them to your own inventory - or leave them to rot in the wastelands you defeated them in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is vast. Your crew is terrible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proceed anyway.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A darkly comic sci-fi deckbuilder. Fight XCOM-style tactical battles to reach the card table, build a deck from a crew of catastrophically unqualified idiots, and decide which broken future survives. Think Inscryption with worse manners.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338430/94e3a63d7be98987ec469471b445dc664ce25540/header.jpg?t=1787915080", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338430/90a037fa207763056129a23b991ca171e100459c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787915080", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4338430/90a037fa207763056129a23b991ca171e100459c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787915080", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 / GT 730 <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core 3.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 / RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["ChristianosWay"], "publishers": ["ChristianosWay"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "lin